Package: yieldlag
Type: Package
Title: Seasonal Climate Responses and Regional Crop Yield Modelling
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mohammad Reza", "Eini", email = "mohammad_eini@sggw.edu.pl",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Fits, tunes, evaluates, compares, and ensembles regional
    statistical crop yield models from monthly weather and yield panels.
    The package implements chronological rolling-origin validation,
    leakage-safe preprocessing, partial pooling, robust regression,
    distributed-lag smoothing, asymmetric weather-anomaly responses,
    compound hot-dry interactions, residual autoregression, empirical
    prediction intervals, and area-weighted aggregation. Prediction
    decomposition and training-range diagnostics support interpretation.
    Row-level predictions and tuning results document model selection
    and reported performance.
